  <tr> 
    <td colspan="5"><div align="center"> 
        <table width="90%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9"><font size="3" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><strong><em>WHAT 
              IS CEPA DATA CENTER?</em></strong></font></td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td height="36" bgcolor="#E9E9E9"> <div align="justify"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">The 
                Data Center is a state-of-the-art software used to support Fleet 
                Safety programs.</font></div></td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9"> <div align="justify"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">The 
                Data Center enables users to record, store, and analyze safety-related 
                fleet data, such as: </font></div></td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9"><blockquote><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">a. 
                Driver Training</font></blockquote></td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9"><blockquote><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">b. 
                Road Traffic Accidents</font></blockquote></td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9"><blockquote><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">c. 
                Vehicle Maintenance</font></blockquote></td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9"><blockquote><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">d. 
                Fleet Mileage</font></blockquote></td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9"><div align="justify"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Based 
                on these records the Data Center is capable of providing information 
                on &#8220;driver records&#8221;, statistic performance figures, 
                as well as present graphs and tables used to manage and plan fleet 
                safety programs that meet the client company&#8217;s needs.</font></div></td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9"><strong><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><em>PRIVACY 
              POLICY</em></font></strong></td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9"><div align="justify"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">The 
                Data Center is governed by the Data Protection Policy of ARMET 
                S.A., a legal entity established in accordance with Uruguayan 
                legislation, trading as Center for Accident Prevention - CEPA&reg; 
                (&quot;CEPA&quot;). The policy can be viewed on the website below:</font></div></td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9"><div align="center"><a href="http://www.cepasafedrive.com" style="text-decoration:none"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">www.cepasafedrive.com</font></a></div></td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9"><strong><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><em>SECURITY 
              POLICY</em></font></strong></td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td height="108" bgcolor="#E9E9E9">
<div align="justify"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">The Data Center 
                is governed by the Electronic Data Processing Security Policy 
                of ARMET S.A., a legal entity established in accordance with Uruguayan 
                legislation, trading as Center for Accident Prevention - CEPA&reg; 
                (&quot;CEPA&quot;). The policy can be viewed on the website below:</font></div></td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>
          <tr> 
            <td bgcolor="#E9E9E9"><div align="center"><a href="http://www.cepasafedrive.com" style="text-decoration:none"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">www.cepasafedrive.com</font></a></div></td>
          </tr>
